{title: Koi Yeh Kaise Bataye}
{artist: Jagjit Singh}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E],        koee ye kaise bataaye ke,
[Am] [E],        wo tanahaa kyon hai
[E],        wo jo apanaa thaa wahee aaur,
[Am],        kisee kaa kyon hai
[Em],        yahee duniyaan hain to fir,
[D] [C],        ayesee ye duniyaan kyon hai
[E] [Am],        yahee hotaa hain to,
[D] [Em] [E7],        aakhir yahee hotaa kyon hai?
[D],        ik jaraa haath badhaa de to,
[G] [D],        pakad le daaman
[D],        us ke seene mein samaa jaaye,
[G] [D],        humaaree dhadakan
[E] [Am],        itanee kurbat hain to fir
[D] [Em] [E7],        faasalaa itanaa kyon hai
